<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1474455476778569892 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1474455476778569892><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/1041982266013909024/99a9a3a76980ac4489c46656667a613c.png?size=512" alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=shroomly_enby data-user-id=1041982266013909024>Shroomly_Enby</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="20 February 2026 05:19 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1474455476778569892>20/02/2026 05:19 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve>???? We were asking people what they wanted to add TO the origins mod pack, what I should have done is had a two answer poll, but that doesn&#39;t change that most people that voted would prefer to not have it. I could do another vote. I could also just not do anything else. Please just communicate more with people about this. It was supposed to be a group thing</span></div></div></div></div><div id=chatlog__message-container-1474455977045786626 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1474455977045786626><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><div class=chatlog__short-timestamp title="20 February 2026 05:21 PM">05:21 PM</div></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve>I also just don&#39;t get the logic of I can&#39;t just ignore it, as it adds a ton of unavoidable mobs to the overworld and I&#39;m fairly certain makes you choose a starter</span></div></div></div></div><div id=chatlog__message-container-1474456125741989978 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1474456125741989978><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><div class=chatlog__short-timestamp title="20 February 2026 05:22 PM">05:22 PM</div></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve>But it&#39;s fine, if you want it, it&#39;s your server and I just won&#39;t play</span></div></div></div></div></div>
